  "instructions": [
    "Cook the noodles according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the vegetable oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the skillet and cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "Remove the chicken from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the skillet and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the heavy cream, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cooked noodles and chicken back to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes to heat through."
